							Authorized under <strong>LTFRB Route E (EDSA Carousel Busway)</strong> Fare Matrix Orders. Base commuter fare is ₱15.00 for the initial 4.0 km with a succeeding distance rate of ₱2.65/km, regulated across all consortium bus operators.
